   "notes": "The paper's primary fit (Table 1: fixed V0=88.967, K0=1.16(14), K0p=8.23(31)); was missing from the hosted database. The room-temperature fit combined Hemley et al. (1989, ref. 45), Finger et al. (1981, ref. 47), and Fei et al.'s new Pt- and Au-scale observations. Fei recalculated the Hemley ruby pressures to the Dewaele et al. (2004) scale. The Hemley and Fei observations are bundled; the Finger rows remain unavailable. Thermal parameters are the paper's MGD fit (not yet used by Dioptas).",
